      "text": "<h2>Pobierz gravity.integration za&nbsp;darmo</h2>\n<p>Podaj firmowy adres e-mail i&nbsp;nazwę firmy, a&nbsp;wyślemy Ci&nbsp;link do&nbsp;pobrania najnowszej wersji gravity.integration. Bezpłatnie, bez&nbsp;zobowiązań, z&nbsp;dołączonym wsparciem technicznym premium.</p>\n                <div class=\"ml-embedded\" data-form=\"gAV0lr\"></div>\n            \n<style>\n.ml-form-embedSubmit { position:absolute !important;left:-9999px !important;opacity:0 !important;pointer-events:none !important; }\n.ml-form-embedBody input[type=\"email\"],\n.ml-form-embedBody input[type=\"text\"] {\n  border:1px solid #464861 !important; border-radius:2rem !important;\n  height:3.5rem !important; padding:0 1.5rem !important;\n  font-family:Epilogue,sans-serif !important; font-size:.75rem !important;\n  background:transparent !important;\n}\n</style>\n<div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;\">\n<a href=\"#\" id=\"gravity-ml-submit\" class=\"btn btn-text btn-arrow btn-download\"><span>Uzyskaj link do&nbsp;pobierania</span></a>\n</div>\n<p><script>\n(function(){\n  function init(){\n    var ourBtn=document.getElementById(\"gravity-ml-submit\");\n    if(ourBtn && !ourBtn.dataset.wired){\n      ourBtn.dataset.wired=\"1\";\n      ourBtn.addEventListener(\"click\",function(e){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var mlBtn=document.querySelector(\".ml-form-embedSubmit button\");\n        if(mlBtn) mlBtn.click();\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  if(document.readyState===\"loading\"){\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\",init);\n  } else { setTimeout(init, 600); }\n})();\n</script></p>\n",
